;margin:0 0 20px"><a href="{{resetLink}}" style="color:#059669">{{resetLink}}</a></p><p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:13px;margin:0;">This link expires in 30 minutes. Did not request this? You can safely ignore this email.</p></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;text-align:center"><p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;margin:0">This is an automated message from PortfoliosBuilder.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>'
