0;font-size:14px">Review Testimonial</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="padding:20px 32px;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;text-align:center"><p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;margin:0">Log in to your admin panel to approve or reject this testimonial.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>'
